WEBVTT

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.410
So that's why you both always hid from me.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.160
I always thought you were doing
some ritual with the photos!

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.790
Hello, Officer Chen.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.040
Did you catch the criminal?

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.290
Did he say anything about Xu Shanshan?

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.790
Uh, the license plate is definitely his,

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:57.000
but now it seems that
he can't be the perpetrator.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Why?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.580
At the time, didn't a victim
named Emma enter his car?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.200
She works at Quede Games.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.080
It's clear the two of them are connected,

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.410
there must be some clues you can find.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.120
You're pretty amazing,

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.250
you could even find out
about these details.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.000
But unfortunately...

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
How is it?
Did they catch that bastard?

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.910
No. Lack of evidence.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:21.160
How is that possible? I clearly...

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.580
According to the information
from our latest investigation,

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.540
Liu Min was not present at the scene
when Emma was killed.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:27.580
What?

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.330
That's the truth.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:32.540
Liu Min was in the hospital
at one o'clock that night.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.660
Besides, surveillance footage
captured Emma

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:41.200
walking alone on an abandoned bridge.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.500
Well, send me Xu Shanshan's information.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.910
You can only report
a missing person after 48 hours.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:50.830
But in the meantime,

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.500
Captain Xiao and I will see
if there's anything we can do.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.000
All right.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Thank you, Officer Chen.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.370
Did they mention Shanshan's whereabouts?

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:02.290
We can't file a report yet,

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.200
so the police can't search for her.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:28.620
I didn't want to have anything
to do with the likes of you,

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.040
but...

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.500
Tell me!

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.000
Where is my money?

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.870
Please,

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.620
please let me go.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:39.120
I don't know what money
you're talking about.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.370
Then let me refresh your memory!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.790
So... is there any other way?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:54.410
Hello? Dong Yi?

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.830
Qiao Ling, do you know
where Xu Shanshan is?

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.660
I called her just now
but her phone was turned off.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:05.870
I don't know,
maybe her phone's battery is dead.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.290
Well, she's always so careless.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.120
Oh, okay.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.910
Then I'll call her again later.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.750
Sorry.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.870
The number you have dialed
cannot be reached at the moment.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:22.870
Sorry.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.410
The number you have dialed
cannot be reached at the moment.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.660
I still can't get through.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.790
Lu Guang, what should we do?

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.700
We can't just sit around doing nothing.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.330
Where did you go after you left yesterday?

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.120
What time did you go home?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.750
After we left, we went to get milk tea,

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.370
then we went our separate ways.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.750
The specific time...

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.580
I can't really remember.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.040
When you were drinking milk tea yesterday,

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.000
or any other time,

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.700
did you take any photos or selfies?

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.540
I don't think so.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.410
What about other times?

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.120
Did Xu Shanshan send you
any selfies or other photos?

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.750
Must it be yesterday?

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.410
Let me check.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.290
Preferably within the past 12 hours.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.830
We didn't talk much last night.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.660
These are all photos from few days ago.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.790
Keep searching,

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.370
maybe you missed one out somewhere.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.500
I'm trying, but there really isn't any.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.120
Did Xu Shanshan
take this photo yesterday?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.290
Oh, yes she did.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.500
Before Shanshan came in here yesterday,

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.830
she was holding up her phone
at the entrance.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.660
It did seem like she was taking a photo.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:24.330
I didn't realize that she had posted it
on WeChat Moments.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.000
Lu Guang, quick, take a look.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.830
See if you can find
any clues about Shanshan.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.830
How is it? Did you find a clue?

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.500
Last night around half past one,

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.950
a masked man broke into
Xu Shanshan's house

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.540
and attacked her.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.910
We need to dive into the photo now!

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:11.910
I want to see...

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:12.870
Hold on.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.330
Are you ready to face
the worst-case scenario?

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:30.200
Even if we could relive
the experience in the photo,

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.620
we cannot change the past.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.500
The moment Xu Shanshan was attacked,

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.500
the connection was broken.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.120
It's very likely that something bad
has happened to her.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.540
If that really is the case,

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.580
Cheng Xiaoshi has to
personally experience it again,

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.580
and he must also accept...

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.120
...her fate.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.040
Let's give him some time.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.410
All of them can leave,

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:08.950
except for you,
you're not allowed to go anywhere!

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.790
Xu Shanshan,

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.910
I have something to tell you.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:15.790
Sorry.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.540
The number you have dialed
cannot be reached at the moment.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.290
Hey, Dong Yi,

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.120
why are you still here?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.160
The interviewer called for you
several times just now.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.000
Ah? Oh, oh.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.410
I'm not ready yet,

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.160
so I won't be going up first.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.540
Forget it, the interview is over anyway.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.910
Sorry.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.540
The number you have dialed
cannot be reached at the moment.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.410
Captain Xiao,
we've just confirmed,

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:09.080
there's nothing wrong with
Liu Min's medical report.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.540
He is indeed paralyzed.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:12.540
Hey, Lu Guang,

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.830
I just checked Xu Shanshan's house.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:14.660
Nobody's home.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:17.700
I'll check the other places
you've provided clues of.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.620
Okay.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.790
Thank you, Officer Chen.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:20.830
Sorry to trouble you.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.750
So, have you decided?

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.040
Yes.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.410
Ready to dive.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.450
Beautiful Miss Xu,

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.750
what are you doing there?

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.330
Let's go in.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.160
Hey! Don't do that,
you're making me embarrassed.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.200
Ahem.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.620
Be careful, don't let Qiao Ling know.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.830
Come on, give it a try.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.250
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.000
Come and receive guests!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.660
Welcome, my landlady...

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.540
Welcome in, Boss!

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.750
Hey,

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:27.200
Xu Shanshan, why are you here
instead of studying?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.200
Am I supposed to yell at myself...

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.660
You accepted the arrangement,

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.410
go on.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.410
Heh,

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:39.750
I'm here because I care about
the reemployment of the jobless.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.910
Oh my, so you're here to observe
the regular people's life.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.700
It's no wonder,

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.870
after all, it's easy to grow out of touch
with society after studying so much,

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.120
I understand.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.000
I have no choice,

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.330
unlike certain people,

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.580
who has rely on others to survive
even after graduation.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:55.910
Can you focus?

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:58.080
Who argues so absent-mindedly?

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.620
Hey! Mind your words,

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:02.200
who's relying on whom to survive?

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:03.910
Am I wrong?

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.200
The house is provided by Qiao,

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:06.410
the business is managed by Lu Guang,

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.750
aren't you just a good-for-nothing?

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:08.870
We are partners!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.620
Don't poison the well if you don't
understand the situation clearly!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:20.700
Mr. Liu, I have finished
tidying up the room.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.160
I will take my leave now.

00:11:58.370 --> 00:11:59.620
Tell me,

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:03.040
why can't they just leave me alone?

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.080
You disgusting insects,

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.450
I'll make you pay!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.410
Since she wants to be famous so badly,

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.120
I'll make her famous all the way.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:21.410
What do you think, my dear friend?

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.620
Hmph, it seems his brain
can't function properly

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.410
without a beating a day.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:34.540
Hey Qiao,

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:38.160
how are they able to
get information of the past from photos?

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.830
I don't know exactly.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.750
They always do it alone every time,

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.330
it's very mysterious.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.620
I can't really trust Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.250
I wonder if he'll do
anything questionable.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.040
Unfortunately, he did.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.250
Um, well, don't worry about it.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.870
I think it's mainly Lu Guang's effort,

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.080
Cheng Xiaoshi is just a tool.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.410
Lu Guang being reliable is good enough.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.620
What?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.040
A tool?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.040
Why do you think that, Qiao Ling?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.040
Ahem.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:10.620
Uh, that's what I thought...

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.910
Even though I say that,

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:18.040
Cheng Xiaoshi does actually
have some tenacity in his spirit.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.910
I couldn't tell.

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.290
He's always been like this.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.000
He doesn't seem to care about anything,

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.370
with a devil-may-care attitude,

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:26.200
but actually...

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.950
What do you think is going on?

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.410
They just left like that?

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.540
Oh my. How could they just
leave the kid alone like that,

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:32.750
how irresponsible.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.790
Exactly.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.250
What about the kid's future?

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.950
Uh, how about we take turns
taking care of him, what do you think?

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:41.000
Are you kidding? Who's going to
be responsible if anything happens?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.040
Then, should we send him
to the orphanage?

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.120
Pooh, pooh, pooh,

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.620
it's not like his parents are dead.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.620
--I think we should call the police first.
--I don't want to!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.330
They just went for a trip,
they will come back!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.830
So I'm not going anywhere!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.620
I don't want your sympathy!

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:55.450
Go away!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.950
--All of you, go away!
--Look at this kid.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.790
He's taking our kindness for granted.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.000
Exactly.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.120
Who wants to take care of this mess?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.750
Do you also think
that my parents won't come back?

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.580
Ah, no.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.120
They'll come back.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.950
I'll wait with you.

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.500
Thank you, Qiao Ling.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.120
Don't thank me,
thank my dad first.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.910
He said he'll lend you
ten years' worth of rent.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.750
When you open the shop again
after you've grown up,

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:27.910
you can return the money then.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:28.950
Wow!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.750
Then I'll have to call you
my landlady in the future!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.410
Even though we tried our best to help him,

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:38.910
he still had a hard time after that.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:43.200
He tried his best to make himself
seem like a normal kid,

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.790
to fit in with the others,

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.080
but in the end...

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.040
...he was still shunned by the others.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:59.000
The news... The news said
there was a huge earthquake last night,

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.080
so many people died!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.500
Were my parents there?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:08.330
Did they encounter the earthquake,
unable to return forever?

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:09.580
Don't be silly.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:12.040
They probably went somewhere even further.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.500
They'll come back safely.

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.330
Qiao Ling!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.540
I miss them!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:23.040
I miss them...

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.330
It was then that I realized

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:29.660
how hurt he must have felt
when he said,

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:31.750
"I don't want your sympathy."

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.120
I had always worried

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:40.370
if Cheng Xiaoshi could make new friends
who genuinely cared about him,

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.580
until...

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.620
What a coincidence.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.870
Hey, Lu Guang!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:53.540
Hey, who's this guy?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:56.500
Cheng Xiaoshi, is he your friend?

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:58.000
I was just passing by.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.370
If you're free,
come give us a hand.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.500
Lu Guang

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.250
miraculously appeared
in our lives just like that.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.620
Back then, I asked him

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.620
how he became friends with Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.370
Can you guess what he said?

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.660
Was he attracted to
Cheng Xiaoshi's beauty?

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:25.870
Don't talk nonsense!

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.830
I'll go get a few cans of Coke.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.120
Get me a sugar-free one.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.870
You're so troublesome.

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:34.000
Lu Guang,

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:37.040
what do you like about Cheng Xiaoshi?

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:38.500
For so many years,

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:42.580
you're the first friend he's had
aside from me.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:45.040
What do you mean, what I like about him?

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.700
He was the one who asked me
to play basketball together.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.500
You two went from
sports buddies to friends,

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:52.700
which means there's something
about him that attracts you.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.750
Own up to it.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:58.330
Maybe because... he's naive.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.620
What does he mean by naive?

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.620
Lu Guang was serious when he said that.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.700
Besides, I agree with him.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:10.450
It's Cheng Xiaoshi's
innocence and openness

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:12.660
that makes people want to protect him.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:16.290
Thank you, Qiao Ling.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.370
Huh?

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.790
Why are you thanking me?

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:19.620
Are you okay?

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.830
You seem weird today!

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:22.250
Let's go get some milk tea.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.160
Happy, happy!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.330
It's almost time for dinner,
why are we getting milk tea?

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:27.660
That'll be our dinner.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.370
Think of it as dieting.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.410
Young man,

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:36.620
you've been walking around
downstairs for the whole day.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:39.580
Have you come to apologize to
your girlfriend after making a mistake?

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.250
I've seen so many people like you.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.410
I don't know what kind of
relationship we have right now.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:50.080
So, I want to wait for an answer.

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:16.830
There's 20 minutes left
to the time of the incident.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.750
How are you? Are you ready?

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.040
Mhmm, no problem.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.160
After the murderer breaks in,
he'll hide in the bathroom.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.700
After you turn on the light,
he'll lunge at you with a knife.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.660
This is the best opportunity
to rip his mask off...

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.910
Lu Guang...

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.580
This time, can you let me take the lead?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.580
You?

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.660
What do you mean?

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.410
Here we are.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.910
You're pretty punctual.

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:49.290
Are you surprised that I'm prepared?

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:52.290
Since I can talk to you through her,

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:56.080
naturally, I have ways
to perceive your every move.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.160
Let's play a game.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:02.080
You'll receive a clue
at ten in the morning.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.540
My phone...

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:17.120
Tomorrow at this time,
use the clue to find me.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.450
Interesting!

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.200
If I win,

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:24.870
will you promise to be my new friend?

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:28.500
I won't inform the police,
but you must ensure Xu Shanshan's safety.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.830
I've locked him inside.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:35.870
Well then,

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:37.580
the game...

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:43.950
...is over!
